Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source is vendored into this repository. Everything under rtl/,
sim/, software/ (excluding the fetched directories named below), fpga/, formal/
and docs/ is original work covered by LICENSE.

Two external projects are used for verification and are fetched at pinned
commits by scripts in this repository. They are downloaded into directories
that .gitignore excludes, are never redistributed here, and remain under their
own licenses:

  riscv-tests
    Upstream:  https://github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-tests
    Fetched by: tests/fetch.sh  ->  tests/riscv-tests/
    License:   BSD-3-Clause (see the LICENSE file in the fetched tree)

  CoreMark
    Upstream:  https://github.com/eembc/coremark
    Fetched by: software/bench/fetch-coremark.sh  ->  software/bench/coremark/
    License:   Apache-2.0, with additional usage terms from EEMBC
    Note:      CoreMark is an EEMBC benchmark and carries rules about how
               scores may be published, including the required reporting
               format and that scores must not be compared across different
               compiler flags without disclosure. Any CoreMark number taken
               from this repository is an unverified self-measurement and is
               not an EEMBC-certified score. See software/bench/README.md.

The port layer for CoreMark (software/bench/core_portme.c, core_portme.h,
crt0_bench.S, link_bench.ld) is original work in this repository and is
covered by LICENSE; the benchmark's own sources are used unmodified and are
not redistributed here.

